    "detailed_description": "Shoot down invaders from another dimension and save the world! Railgun X Tripod is a missile defense simulator in which the player becomes a human tripod and operates a heavy but powerful railgun with various upgrades to eliminate hordes of enemies from the sky before they reach our city! <br />\r\n<br />\r\nCaution: This heavy railgun isn't manufactured to be operated by a single individual as a tripod. prepare for &quot;foreseen&quot; consequences...<br />\r\n<br />\r\nAdvices for those who ever try to :<br />\r\n- Even aiming the target properly will not be easy.<br />\r\n- Take good care of your stamina. Otherwise, you will collapse under the weight of the railgun.<br />\r\n- Railgun consume a lot of energy to operate. Try to aim wisely to effectively eliminate as many enemies as possible with each shot.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nKnown facts :<br />\r\n- Invader's purpose is unknown. The only thing we are sure of is that they want to destroy our city.<br />\r\n- Enemy invasion occurs in multiple waves. The last wave usually includes highly dangerous special entity.<br />\r\n- In our study, we found that certain types of invaders contain huge amounts of the mysterious material DOG-8.<br />\r\n- Sufficient amount of DOG-8 could be used to upgrade the railgun into several different direction.",
